      "description_tr": "🎧 Quality, comfort and excellent performance for your day to day!\n\nPeining PEI-SZ01 and PEI-EP06 headphones deliver Hi-Fi stereo audio with powerful bass, providing a clear and immersive sound experience to listen to music, watch videos, make calls and participate in online meetings.\n\nBoth have an integrated microphone, volume control on the cable and an ergonomic design, ensuring comfort even after long periods of use.\n\nThe main difference between the models is in the connector:\n\n* PEI-SZ01: USB-C connector, compatible with smartphones, tablets and devices with USB-C input.\n* PEI-EP06: Lightning connector, ideal for iPhones and other compatible Apple devices.\n\nCharacteristics\n\n* ✅ Hi-Fi Stereo Sound\n* ✅ Powerful bass\n* ✅ Built-in microphone\n* ✅ Volume Control\n* ✅ Comfortable and lightweight Design\n* ✅ Excellent audio quality for music, calls and videos\n* ✅ Sturdy and durable cable\n\nAvailable Models\n\n* PEI-SZ01 – USB-C Connector\n* PEI-EP06 – Lightning Connector\n\n📦 New product, sealed and ready delivery.\n🚚 Fast shipping to all Brazil.",
