        {
          "type": 0,
          "text": "Peining PEI-SZ01 and PEI-EP06 headphones deliver Hi-Fi stereo audio with powerful bass, providing a clear and immersive sound experience to listen to music, watch videos, make calls and participate in online meetings.",
